        advancing after max rank so "best zone" keeps moving forward.
      * Black-screen status UI only (no config on screen). RightCtrl / Insert / the "H" button toggles it.
      * Mobile: touch toggle button + UIScale for small screens.
      * 24/7: rejoin on disconnect/kick, stall watchdog, optional timed rejoin, re-exec after teleports.
      * Many instances: 3D rendering off behind the black screen, FPS cap, event-driven breakable registry,
        a single worker thread for every yielding action, UI text written only when it changes.
      * No Robux: no product, gamepass or gifting remote is referenced anywhere.

    Config override (before loading):  getgenv().HayamiConfig = { FpsCap = 10, AutoBuyEggSlots = false }
